; `emacro` was removed (AX2004): it spelled the rule form for
; expression templates, and `macro` takes the same rules. The word stays
; reserved so old source gets the rewrite instead of a call to an
; undefined macro.
(emacro total
  ((total x) x)
  ((total x rest ...) (+ x (total rest ...))))

(:: main Int)
(fn (main)
  (total 1 2 3))
